<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Before God put the clouds in the sky...</l><l>Before He taught the birds how to fly...</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Before God made the sun giving light...</l><l>Before God made the stars shining bright...</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Before God put the whales in the sea...</l><l>Before God made the fish swimming free...</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Before God made the insects that creep...</l><l>Before God made the cattle and sheep...</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
